extends layout

block content
  .col-md-12.cardSpacer
    #page-header-container(style='align-items:flex-start')
      #page-title-container
        h3#page-title Contact SumExplorer
        .sub-page-header.text-muted Report explorer display issues, broken pages, or public data problems safely.
      .cardSpacer.clearfix

    .card.card-default.border-0.cardSpacer
      .card-header
        strong Before contacting anyone
      .card-body
        p.lead.mb-3 SumExplorer displays public blockchain information only. It cannot access private wallets, recover funds, reverse transactions, or reset wallet credentials.
        p.mb-0 If you need help with a wallet application, exchange deposit, private key, or recovery phrase, contact the wallet provider or service involved. Never share private keys, seed words, passwords, or backup files with anyone.

    .row
      .col-md-6.cardSpacer
        .card.card-default.border-0.h-100
          .card-header
            strong Useful details to include
          .card-body
            ul.mb-0
              li The full SumExplorer page URL.
              li A transaction ID, block height, block hash, or public address.
              li A short description of what appears incorrect.
              li Screenshots if the issue is visual or intermittent.
              li The approximate time you noticed the issue.
      .col-md-6.cardSpacer
        .card.card-default.border-0.h-100
          .card-header
            strong Do not send
          .card-body
            ul.mb-0
              li Private keys.
              li Recovery phrases or seed words.
              li Wallet passwords.
              li Exchange login details.
              li Personal identity documents unless specifically required by the service you are contacting.

    .card.card-default.border-0.cardSpacer
      .card-header
        strong Community and project links
      .card-body
        p Sumcoin community links are available in the footer of this site. Those channels are generally better for wallet questions, project discussion, and community support.
        p.mb-0 For explorer-specific issues, include public blockchain identifiers only. Public transaction IDs and public addresses are enough for most troubleshooting.
